Rhythm/sound-design patch -- tanpura drone + micro-timing/accelerando + optional
pentatonic pitch contour for the tabla path.
=====================================================================
NOT APPLIED. Sketch only, produced during the rhythm/sound exploration
(docs/reviews/11-rhythm-sound-exploration.md). Demo: see that report for the
scratchpad demo.html this was validated against by ear.

Target: original_base.html (re-mirror via scripts/build_app.py as usual; never
hand-edit index.html / "urdu-meter-trainer 2.html" directly). Matched against
the copy of original_base.html read while this patch was written -- verify each
"old" block is still a single-occurrence match (grep -Fc) before applying.

Recommended combination (see report): micro-timing/rubato + drone ON by default
for the 'tabla' sound; pentatonic pitch contour OFF by default behind a new
settings.melodicContour toggle, since it changes the tabla's character more
than the owner may want as a default. All three are purely additive: existing
call sites of play(seq, opts) are unchanged.

